 in hard  fast go for a shooter if you like  hanging back and picking off people from  a distance like a charger or a splatling  would be really good and so once you  found your weapon type go in try all the  different sub weapons customize your  gear to make sure it fits your playstyle  and see what works best for you that's  all I can really say about that the  weapons are so different in this game  and you're bound to find one that you  really really like alright guys if you  liked this video make sure to leave a  comment below telling me what your  favorite weapons are what your favorite  sub weapons specials weapon types if  you're a charger fan let me know I want  to hang out with you  brush fan stay away from me if you found  this video helpful please leave a like  or even consider subscribing to our  channel with helped me out a whole lot  so thanks for watching and I will see  you squids next time  [Music]

